// VT, FF or CR ends before the `@` holds the colon and not the `@` (the
// review of 4d13d71: `http://qqqqqq:zz<TAB>zz@cdn.test/x` printed `qqqqqq`
// as its host, where its scheme-less twin was withheld). The cost, stated:
